00:25:29.550 --> 00:26:02.630
<v Mark Gediman>To make a long story short, the thing really kind of fell apart. And, at this point, I really got just totally discouraged with the whole scene. And, in fact, I remember just feeling like that what I really had inside me wasn't coming out. And I took this microphone-- I still have it to this day-- and I threw it up against the wall. I don't know. It's all smashed in. I just left and never went back. I left everything I had that was related to music in that room, and just, basically, quit.
<v Mark Gediman>长话短说，事情真的搞砸了。在那一刻，我对整个圈子彻底灰心了。事实上，我记得我感觉自己真正想表达的东西没能出来。我拿起麦克风——我至今还留着它——把它砸向了墙。我不知道。它完全变形了。我离开了，再没回头。我把所有和音乐有关的东西都留在了那个房间，基本上就放弃了。

