<v Dan Gediman>My brother left music completely for many years after this time, around 1984. For a while he dabbled with a little home recording setup trying to write some songs, but his heart wasn't in it. He stopped going out to clubs, lost touch with most of his musician friends, didn't play, didn't perform, just left. Then, in 1991, seven years later, he discovered karaoke.
<v Dan Gediman>在那之后，大约从1984年起，我弟弟多年来完全离开了音乐。有一段时间，他尝试过一点家庭录音设备，试图写几首歌，但他已无心于此。他不再去夜店，和大多数音乐朋友断了联系，不演奏，不表演，就那样离开了。然后，在1991年，七年后，他发现了卡拉OK。

